{
  "name": "Intake Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9929)\n- Webhook: POST **/intake-brief**, body `{ briefId, content }`; **Monday.com webhook secret** (header auth on webhook).\n- Base URL: `$env.BACKEND_BASE_URL` for all MPA HTTP calls.\n- Valid brief: non-empty `briefId` and `content`, `content.trim().length >= 5` (test payload `12345` / `Sample brief content` passes).\n- Invalid shape: missing fields → recorded via **POST /v1/intake/event-record** then stop.\n- Duplicate `briefId`: same endpoint with `event: duplicate` (dedupe: **Mark Brief Id Complete** records briefId only after gap-messages or planning hand-off succeeds).\n- MPA: **POST /v1/intake/validate-brief**; gaps → **POST /v1/intake/gap-messages**; valid → **POST /v1/intake/planning-run** then **Execute Workflow** id `PlanningWorkflow` with `requestId`, `qaResult=Pass`.\n- Failures: **POST /v1/intake/team-alert**; run ends with **Stop and Error**.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "f1e2d3c4-b5a6-9780-1234-567890abcdef",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -80
      ]
    },
